1
00:00:00,480 --> 00:00:02,939
Didi! Aadha mohalla aa gaya!

2
00:00:04,024 --> 00:00:05,693
Beta, jaldi!

3
00:00:06,019 --> 00:00:06,952
Pehle mera!

4
00:00:07,885 --> 00:00:09,797
Sabka bill, saath-saath!

5
00:00:12,293 --> 00:00:15,391
F2, dawa. F9, bill.

6
00:00:16,575 --> 00:00:18,450
Jeeti raho, beta!

7
00:00:19,475 --> 00:00:21,233
Arre! Purse gaadi mein!

8
00:00:21,478 --> 00:00:23,378
Jaaiye, bill khula hai.

9
00:00:27,999 --> 00:00:29,580
Bill phone pe bhej do!

10
00:00:32,338 --> 00:00:34,771
Bhej diya — dukaan ke number se!

11
00:00:35,888 --> 00:00:36,486
Aa gayi!

12
00:00:36,727 --> 00:00:38,693
Bill taiyaar — Happy Diwali!

13
00:00:40,389 --> 00:00:44,742
Raunak aapki, raftaar hamari. Shubh Deepawali!
